							<name><text xml:lang="en" slug="team-learning"><![CDATA[Team learning]]></text></name>
							<layout><text xml:lang="en"><![CDATA[
<h1>Learning and safety</h1><p>Give each team access to its current training resources, workplace guidance, and contacts for raising concerns.</p>
<p>Organization-specific resources can be linked here when available.</p>
							]]></text></layout>
						</content>
